From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: OpenSourceSDRLab <support@opensourcesdrlab.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 22:46:21 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] 7100_2XAD9361 board support

Changes to the Analog Devices Linux kernel (branch 2022_R2,
commit 7aa63204d396316bb6c362b34294babae7a6f32b) for the
OpenSourceSDRLab 7100_2XAD9361 board (XC7Z100 + two AD9361):

- adf5355: optional adi,pdbrf-gpio to drive the RFOUTA power-down pin,
  kept in sync with out_altvoltage0_powerdown
- device trees: XC7Z100 board (UART0 console, Ethernet PHY at address 0,
  USB PHY reset on MIO46, W25Q256 QSPI flash partitions), FMCOMMS5
  external LO from the on-board ADF5355, ZC706-only peripherals removed
---
 arch/arm/boot/dts/adi-fmcomms5.dtsi           | 18 ++----
 ...adv7511-ad9361-fmcomms5-ext-lo-adf5355.dts |  4 +-
 .../zynq-zc706-adv7511-ad9361-fmcomms5.dts    |  7 ---
 arch/arm/boot/dts/zynq-zc706-adv7511.dtsi     |  7 ++-
 arch/arm/boot/dts/zynq-zc706.dtsi             | 61 ++++++++++++++++---
 arch/arm/boot/dts/zynq.dtsi                   |  4 +-
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/xilinx/adi-fmcomms5.dtsi  |  4 +-
 drivers/iio/frequency/adf5355.c               | 25 ++++++++
 include/linux/iio/frequency/adf5355.h         |  5 ++
 9 files changed, 96 insertions(+), 39 deletions(-)

diff --git a/arch/arm/boot/dts/adi-fmcomms5.dtsi b/arch/arm/boot/dts/adi-fmcomms5.dtsi
